Augias logo and icon
====================

Files: logo.svg, icon.svg, logo.png, and every raster derived from them
(public/favicon.ico, public/apple-touch-icon.png, docs/static/img/logo.png,
docs/static/img/favicon.ico, docs/static/img/augias-social-card.png), plus the
base64 copy embedded in GlobalExtension::DEFAULT_LOGO.

These files are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International licence (CC BY 4.0). You may copy, modify and distribute them,
including commercially, provided you give appropriate credit and indicate
whether changes were made.

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Note that this is deliberately *not* the MIT licence covering the source code,
and deliberately not CC0. A mark exists to say who made something, so a licence
that lets it travel with no attribution lets anyone present their own work as
this project's. CC BY keeps the files free while requiring that the credit stay
attached.

The mark is original to Augias. It does not derive from the SolidInvoice logo,
which remains the property of its author — the MIT licence covering the source
code does not extend to that project's trademarks or brand assets.
